{"id":"erede","lemma":"erede","pos":"noun","rank":3260,"glosses":["heir, inheritor"],"ipa":"/eˈrɛ.de/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2f/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-erede.wav/LL-Q652_%28ita%29-LangPao-erede.wav.mp3","gender":"mf","forms":{"plural":"eredi"},"examples":[{"text":"Essendo figlio unico, era il solo erede.","en":"Being an only child, he was the sole heir.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"only, just"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"male only child"]]},{"text":"Tom è morto senza eredi.","en":"Tom died without heirs.","words":[null,{"g":"is","l":"essere"},{"g":"dead man"},{"g":"without, -less"},null]},{"text":"Quale principe è l'erede legittimo al trono?","en":"Which prince is the legitimate heir to the throne?","words":[{"g":"what?"},{"g":"prince"},{"g":"is","l":"essere"},null,null,{"g":"legitimate"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"throne"}]},{"text":"Essendo figlio unico, era l'unico erede.","en":"Being an only child, he was the sole heir.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,null,{"g":"to be","l":"essere"},null,{"g":"only"},null],"phrases":[[1,3,"male only child"]]},{"text":"Tom morì senza eredi.","en":"Tom died without heirs.","words":[null,{"g":"to die","l":"morire"},{"g":"without, -less"},null]}]}